        "description": "Generic provider configurations for official DashScope/Qwen, Moonshot, Z.AI, DeepSeek, Groq, Cerebras, and Chutes endpoints now retain the compatibility behavior those services require even without optional plugins. [#100125](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/100125)",
