        "description": "Supported non-English native apps now translate workspace file browsing and sharing, image preview failures, offline status, and custom Gateway header controls. [6b99fd9](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/commit/6b99fd9a94ce99023c77e733efe7943e4f51c285)",
